<title>USA: Metrowerks to develop chip tools for NEC.</title>
<headline>Metrowerks to develop chip tools for NEC.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metrowerks Inc Wednesday said it has entered into an agreement with NEC Corp's NEC Electronics Inc to develop compilers and debugging support tools for NEC's chips.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Metrowerks said it will develop the tools for NEC's V4100, V4300 and V5000 series of 64-bit MIPS RISC series of 64-bit MIPS RISC processors, as well as their V810 and V830 series of 32-bit controllers.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
